func=jag::HitmarksAndHeadbars::AddHitmark	func_addr=0x0037c0d0	kind=pre	insn_offset_from_entry=0	cu_index_from_entry=0	text=Reached from PathingEntity::AddHitmark (0x00324390), which forwards (entity+0xf08, entity+0x78, ...). Ring lives in HitmarksAndHeadbars: +0x0 cursor, +0x4 capacity, +0x20 record array; record stride 0x18. Writes [0]\etype [1]\edamage [2]\ecycle+defTicks+delay [3]\esoak [4]\eextra [5]\edefTicks. `owner` is the config provider; hitmark domain index global is DAT_00c6bfa8; def+0x44 \e defTicks (0x46 when the def is missing), def+0x80 \e overwrite policy (-1 drop, 0 evict lowest end-cycle, 1 evict lowest damage and require damage &gt; min, other \e slot 0).
